claim.claim-text:
a placement step of placing a molten thermoplastic resin having a tubular shape inside the mold (100) in a state where an axial dimension of the recess (130) of the inner wall surface (110) is set to the primary molding distance;
a primary molding step of blowing air into the thermoplastic resin placed inside the mold (100) in the placement step to deform the thermoplastic resin along the inner wall surface (110) of the mold (100); and
a secondary molding step of compressing, in the axial direction, a portion of the thermoplastic resin that is molded in the primary molding step and enters the recess (130) by changing the axial dimension of the recess (130) of the inner wall surface (110) to the final molding distance.
